sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Q as Worker Queue
  participant W as Worker
  participant D as DynamoDB Orders
  participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue
  participant CW as CloudWatch Alarm
  participant Ops as Operator

  Q->>W: Deliver message attempt 1
  W->>D: Conditional write begins
  W--xW: Crash or retryable failure
  Q-->>Q: Visibility timeout expires
  Q->>W: Redeliver message attempts 2..5
  W--xW: Fails repeatedly
  Q->>DLQ: Redrive after max receives
  DLQ->>CW: Visible messages > 0
  CW->>Ops: Notify owner role
  Ops->>DLQ: Inspect, fix, replay or archive with audit note

